  "conclusion": "The x86 Windows D3D9 runtime loaded the experimental UMD and NVK in FTEQW. The surviving trace records four successful opens of the GM20B and two D3DDDICAPS_GETD3D9CAPS queries rejected with D3DERR_NOTAVAILABLE. Both requested D3D9 window sizes failed, then FTE began its OpenGL fallback before an unexpected reboot. A separate run on the existing app-local x86 DXVK used the ordinary ARM64 KMD and identified native NVK GM20B before another reboot. Neither run recorded a normal exit."
